// The pause banner pins to the top of the app and is the highest layer on the
// scale — nothing may cover it, because while it shows every write in the
// league is blocked and the member needs to keep seeing why. It stays in flow
// (sticky) so it occupies vertical space, and it publishes its rendered height
// to --app-banner-height so the top-anchored fixed surfaces (.page, the nav
// drawer) push themselves down rather than being covered. A bare number here
// would fail `yarn check:z-index-scale`, and the point of the scale is that
// the whole stacking order is reviewable in one file.
.league-pause-notice
  position sticky
  top 0
  z-index $z_banner
